    "show_share": true,
    "description": "CIME arranged a 12-faculty party of Pakistan Air Force (PAF) doctors, general surgeons and obstetrics & gynaecology for a two days' workshop tailored specifically for them. An introduction to the principles and different manifestations of simulation-based education was followed by an illustrated tour of the facility.",
